<p>My research is in the field of Data Visualization with an emphasis on mobile data visualization and visualization literacy. In the field of Mobile Data Visualization, we have developed novel techniques to provide context to viewers as they explore data on small screens. For the visualization literacy field, we have explored the use of Bloom’s taxonomy to introduce individuals to unfamiliar visualization techniques such as Treemaps and Parallel Coordinates Plots.</p>

<p>Through the ability of individuals to critically evaluate visualizations that they experience on social media and in their daily lives, they can get a better sense of the data they is being represented or misrepresented. Through the increase in visualization literacy, we plan to help individuals develop a critical approach to read charts and, potentially, reduce the spread of misinformation.</p>

